WEBVTT

01:33.390 --> 01:35.661
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.721 --> 01:38.021
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.090 --> 01:40.991
(Episode 27)

01:41.131 --> 01:42.431
His son is not as good as you.

01:43.131 --> 01:44.030
But he's better...

01:44.400 --> 01:45.530
at pleasing people.

01:45.631 --> 01:46.631
Mom knows he's not as good as me,

01:47.571 --> 01:49.471
yet she even arranged for Qin Qin to go on a blind date with him.

01:50.241 --> 01:51.411
He's not as capable as you,

01:51.471 --> 01:52.840
but he has good character.

01:53.670 --> 01:55.540
How many in Yancheng...

01:55.780 --> 01:57.181
will pass your standards?

01:57.510 --> 01:58.211
You're so picky.

01:58.280 --> 01:59.381
How can your sister...

01:59.810 --> 02:00.810
get married?

02:01.551 --> 02:02.681
It's fine if she doesn't.

02:03.051 --> 02:03.821
It's not like we can't afford to support her.

02:05.691 --> 02:07.090
What are you saying?

02:08.321 --> 02:09.420
I really don't understand...

02:09.491 --> 02:10.691
young people these days.

02:11.661 --> 02:13.491
Mr. Gu's daughter is so nice,

02:14.161 --> 02:15.601
but you don't like her either.

02:22.340 --> 02:23.400
What have you been busy with lately?

02:23.600 --> 02:24.641
Why don't you come home on weekends?

02:26.541 --> 02:27.741
It's the end of the year.

02:29.011 --> 02:29.741
I'm a little busy.

02:29.810 --> 02:30.981
Qin Qin is the same.

02:31.310 --> 02:32.581
Since she came back from the disaster area,

02:32.681 --> 02:33.581
she hasn't been home.

02:33.711 --> 02:34.981
Every time I call her,

02:35.051 --> 02:35.921
she says she's busy.

02:36.051 --> 02:37.820
I don't know what you guys are busy with.

02:40.491 --> 02:41.660
Did she not come home last weekend either?

02:41.891 --> 02:42.761
No.

02:56.248 --> 02:57.678
We'll get going then, Dr. Xu.

02:57.741 --> 02:58.541
Bye.

03:03.280 --> 03:03.981
Are you off work?

03:04.241 --> 03:05.051
I'm on my way.

03:10.451 --> 03:11.350
I'll be late today.

03:11.421 --> 03:12.690
I'll leave in 10 minutes.

03:15.861 --> 03:16.560
Okay.

03:41.451 --> 03:42.620
(Xu Qin)

04:20.320 --> 04:21.090
Yan Chen.

04:33.200 --> 04:34.101
Go upstairs.

04:36.000 --> 04:36.841
Come home with me.

04:48.281 --> 04:49.080
Meng Yan Chen.

04:50.450 --> 04:51.450
You're her brother.

04:56.760 --> 04:58.231
You two can't be together.

05:06.700 --> 05:08.031
As long as Mom and Dad disapprove,

05:09.000 --> 05:10.541
you two can't be together.

05:11.370 --> 05:13.210
All this time you've been together,

05:13.440 --> 05:14.741
she hasn't come home...

05:15.181 --> 05:16.310
because she's evading the issue.

05:17.781 --> 05:19.010
Don't you get it?

05:23.921 --> 05:24.950
Don't worry about it.

05:25.491 --> 05:26.551
Whether I can make her stay or not...

05:27.520 --> 05:28.560
is up to me.

05:29.091 --> 05:29.760
Yes.

05:30.390 --> 05:31.120
Make her stay.

05:32.161 --> 05:32.960
Then what?

05:33.491 --> 05:35.000
Let her give up everything for you...

05:35.801 --> 05:37.531
and satisfy your own desires.

05:38.330 --> 05:39.630
Can you live with that?

05:40.870 --> 05:41.640
Song Yan.

05:42.601 --> 05:43.671
Ask yourself.

05:45.270 --> 05:46.411
Do you deserve her?

06:20.010 --> 06:21.640
Look at this neighborhood.

06:22.481 --> 06:23.541
Look at yourself.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.911
Can't you see?

06:27.281 --> 06:28.880
You were dumped back then...

06:29.481 --> 06:30.651
because our parents didn't approve.

06:31.181 --> 06:33.921
If you had any guts or backbone,

06:34.091 --> 06:35.091
you would have found a way...

06:35.161 --> 06:36.791
and tried everything to become successful...

06:36.921 --> 06:38.161
and be worthy of her.

06:38.690 --> 06:39.830
But look at yourself.

06:40.231 --> 06:41.390
What do you have?

06:41.560 --> 06:42.861
What can you give her?

06:43.630 --> 06:44.861
You're making her fight...

06:45.770 --> 06:47.431
against everything she has for your sake.

06:49.541 --> 06:50.570
Song Yan.

06:56.510 --> 06:57.810
What rights do you have?

07:04.921 --> 07:05.921
Meng Yan Chen.

07:07.750 --> 07:08.791
Do you know her?

07:11.760 --> 07:13.591
Aside from knowing she's sensitive...

07:13.890 --> 07:15.200
and enigmatic,

07:16.830 --> 07:18.031
what else do you know?

07:21.741 --> 07:23.870
You don't know her at all.

07:25.310 --> 07:25.971
Yes.

07:26.971 --> 07:28.510
You hated me 10 years ago.

07:29.181 --> 07:30.681
You hated me for teaching her how to smoke,

07:31.041 --> 07:31.851
drink,

07:32.411 --> 07:33.080
and fight.

07:34.051 --> 07:34.950
The truth is...

07:36.781 --> 07:37.750
she asked me...

07:37.921 --> 07:39.551
to take her to the bar.

07:40.091 --> 07:40.950
I don't fight,

07:41.520 --> 07:43.091
so she picked fights with people.

07:44.620 --> 07:45.791
Do you know why?

07:48.531 --> 07:49.601
She wants to have fun.

07:50.231 --> 07:51.200
She wants to be wild.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.601
She wants to be crazy.

07:53.000 --> 07:54.031
She wants to be free.

07:55.401 --> 07:56.700
She has been repressed for too long.

07:57.471 --> 07:58.911
That's why she was so extreme.

08:02.640 --> 08:03.640
At that time,

08:05.750 --> 08:06.950
at least she was alive.

08:10.880 --> 08:11.651
So...

08:13.320 --> 08:14.651
you're asking me what right do I have?

08:18.960 --> 08:20.690
Because of her laughter just now.

08:23.130 --> 08:24.830
At that time, at least she was living like a human.

08:25.171 --> 08:26.031
What about now?

08:27.630 --> 08:29.000
It has been 10 years.

08:29.770 --> 08:31.471
She has been repressed to the point of being passionless.

08:32.171 --> 08:33.870
Don't you know her personality?

08:35.310 --> 08:36.440
She's cold on the outside...

08:37.041 --> 08:38.411
and she seems like she doesn't care about anything.

08:40.080 --> 08:40.911
In reality,

08:41.651 --> 08:42.850
she's just a coward.

08:43.320 --> 08:44.521
No matter how well she pretends,

08:44.681 --> 08:46.051
she's just a pushover.

08:46.690 --> 08:48.190
Even if she represses herself to death,

08:49.121 --> 08:50.820
she won't complain to you.

08:51.521 --> 08:53.190
She treats you like family.

08:54.960 --> 08:56.330
What do you treat her as?

08:59.070 --> 09:00.531
A pawn...

09:00.801 --> 09:02.041
for a business marriage...

09:02.470 --> 09:04.440
to pave the way for your family's business.

09:05.470 --> 09:06.710
I won't use her for that.

09:06.810 --> 09:08.041
Can you protect her?

09:09.511 --> 09:11.011
You can't even protect yourself from that.

09:11.850 --> 09:12.710
Meng Yan Chen.

09:19.950 --> 09:20.950
My parents...

09:22.590 --> 09:24.121
were not as bad as you described.

09:24.360 --> 09:26.931
They do have their own set of rules.

09:27.531 --> 09:29.161
This rule does suppress Qin Qin...

09:29.401 --> 09:30.560
and me.

09:30.830 --> 09:31.631
However,

09:32.001 --> 09:33.531
Qin Qin is her daughter.

09:33.801 --> 09:35.271
They treat her like their own.

09:37.641 --> 09:38.440
Meng Yan Chen.

09:38.840 --> 09:39.810
As you know,

09:40.911 --> 09:42.381
she's not just Meng Qin,

09:43.810 --> 09:45.041
but she's also Xu Qin.

09:50.381 --> 09:51.051
Go home.

09:52.121 --> 09:53.151
You and your family...

09:54.990 --> 09:56.220
should stop giving her a hard time.

10:13.271 --> 10:14.470
She has chronic insomnia.

10:16.310 --> 10:18.041
She needs sleeping pills to sleep.

10:18.411 --> 10:19.151
Do you know that?

10:21.051 --> 10:22.381
You said this neighborhood is nice.

10:23.980 --> 10:24.881
Yes, it is.

10:26.950 --> 10:28.251
The buildings are nice too.

10:29.690 --> 10:30.521
They're very high.

10:32.190 --> 10:33.190
Meng Yan Chen.

10:34.690 --> 10:35.860
Look up.

10:37.431 --> 10:39.230
Judging from her condition before,

10:41.200 --> 10:42.401
could she jump...

10:46.511 --> 10:47.610
from up there...

10:48.271 --> 10:49.281
one day?

11:03.021 --> 11:04.090
No one in your family...

11:04.921 --> 11:06.360
has the right to talk to me...

11:07.531 --> 11:09.330
about whether I deserve her or not.

11:32.450 --> 11:33.651
You didn't fight, did you?

11:36.521 --> 11:37.190
Go.

11:37.621 --> 11:38.590
Go downstairs and take a look.

12:54.671 --> 12:55.600
What's wrong with you lately?

12:56.340 --> 12:57.100
Nothing.

12:58.171 --> 12:59.210
Do you think I'll believe that?

13:03.511 --> 13:04.641
What do you want me to say?

13:13.690 --> 13:15.051
You shouldn't drink alcohol this way.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.220
You have to savor it slowly.

13:17.560 --> 13:19.131
It's supposed to make people happy.

13:19.230 --> 13:20.730
It's not for you to drown your sorrows.

13:21.391 --> 13:22.531
Who's the reason you're drinking again now?

13:23.161 --> 13:24.401
It has nothing to do with anyone.

13:26.371 --> 13:27.470
I just want to drink.

13:28.470 --> 13:29.470
Do you have to do this?

13:30.440 --> 13:31.871
You're torturing yourself this way.

13:34.771 --> 13:35.810
There are two caterpillars...

13:38.080 --> 13:39.710
that live in a dark hole.

13:41.480 --> 13:42.720
There's no light.

13:43.781 --> 13:44.850
It's very depressing.

13:47.521 --> 13:48.891
They're just caterpillars.

13:51.021 --> 13:52.690
They couldn't escape.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.360
But good thing there are two of them.

13:57.001 --> 13:58.560
They can depend on each other.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.301
Although it's dark,

14:05.671 --> 14:06.771
they have each other.

14:07.970 --> 14:09.411
But one day,

14:12.411 --> 14:13.881
one suddenly emerges...

14:15.450 --> 14:16.881
and flies away as a butterfly.

14:18.181 --> 14:19.651
Only one caterpillar is left...

14:21.891 --> 14:23.121
in the hole.

14:25.990 --> 14:27.131
He can't see the light of day.

14:28.560 --> 14:31.360
The other caterpillar will turn into a butterfly too.

14:32.470 --> 14:34.171
There are too many butterflies out there.

14:37.371 --> 14:38.440
No matter how hard he looks,

14:41.871 --> 14:43.881
he won't be able to find that caterpillar before.

14:49.281 --> 14:50.521
In the past, you and your sister...

14:50.580 --> 14:52.251
were suppressed by your mom together.

14:52.720 --> 14:55.051
Now, Qin Er wants to pursue her own happiness.

14:55.921 --> 14:57.621
The pressure she and Song Yan will face...

14:57.690 --> 14:59.431
is 1,000 times greater than yours.

14:59.891 --> 15:01.031
Compared to you,

15:01.360 --> 15:02.860
they're braver.

15:03.801 --> 15:04.761
No matter what,

15:05.671 --> 15:06.871
once you fly out,

15:07.431 --> 15:08.940
a big world is out there.

15:09.740 --> 15:11.901
It's better than staying in the dark forever.

15:24.950 --> 15:26.651
He's always been very sensible.

15:27.190 --> 15:28.151
What happened today...

15:28.490 --> 15:29.460
was a surprise to me too.

15:30.820 --> 15:31.791
I know.

15:32.631 --> 15:33.791
I knew it all along.

15:35.360 --> 15:36.531
What do you know?

15:38.360 --> 15:39.771
That it's not easy for you...

15:40.330 --> 15:41.070
to be in that family.

15:41.401 --> 15:42.771
It's not that it's not easy.

15:43.801 --> 15:44.901
Relationships with family...

15:45.470 --> 15:47.310
aren't so simple that you can clearly say...

15:47.371 --> 15:48.440
who's right and who's wrong.

15:50.210 --> 15:51.881
You think my mom is fierce, right?

15:53.310 --> 15:54.110
Indeed.

15:55.251 --> 15:56.621
She's very controlling.

15:58.181 --> 15:59.320
But you know what?

15:59.850 --> 16:00.791
When I was little...

16:00.990 --> 16:02.261
and I was sick and had a fever,

16:02.791 --> 16:04.161
she was the one...

16:04.560 --> 16:05.391
who stayed by my side all night.

16:07.522 --> 16:08.992
When someone bullied me,

16:09.730 --> 16:11.261
she was the one who stood up for me.

16:12.060 --> 16:13.230
Surprising, right?

16:16.570 --> 16:18.371
That's just my mom's personality.

16:18.570 --> 16:19.511
She treats Meng Yan Chen and I...

16:19.810 --> 16:20.871
the same way.

16:23.310 --> 16:25.281
My brother and I are really quite alike.

16:27.350 --> 16:29.151
We're like caterpillars.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.781
We put ourselves in a cocoon.

16:33.121 --> 16:34.990
We think we're in a safe zone.

16:38.291 --> 16:39.360
Once this area...

16:39.431 --> 16:40.960
changes in any way,

16:41.730 --> 16:43.560
we'll suddenly lose our sense of security.

16:45.600 --> 16:47.171
Right now, my brother feels like...

16:47.931 --> 16:49.470
one caterpillar has escaped.

16:50.070 --> 16:51.200
He has no companion anymore.

16:51.871 --> 16:53.070
He's abandoned.

16:55.710 --> 16:57.210
So he feels uneasy.

17:05.121 --> 17:06.450
From now on, your safe zone...

17:07.891 --> 17:08.651
is me.

17:27.841 --> 17:28.510
Hot water.

17:30.210 --> 17:31.141
Where's the alcohol?

17:32.111 --> 17:33.681
That alcohol belongs to the boss.

17:34.111 --> 17:34.950
I'll buy a bottle.

17:37.681 --> 17:38.450
What do you want?

17:38.520 --> 17:39.321
Anything.

17:40.121 --> 17:40.891
Got it.

17:48.131 --> 17:49.230
I'm at the restaurant.

17:50.161 --> 17:51.101
Okay, I got it.

17:51.161 --> 17:51.831
Okay.

17:52.131 --> 17:53.131
Wait.

17:53.831 --> 17:55.200
Okay, I'll be right home.

17:56.171 --> 17:57.000
Who is the alcohol for?

17:57.071 --> 17:57.740
Mr. Meng.

17:58.641 --> 17:59.811
Who told you to open alcohol for him?

18:00.040 --> 18:00.740
He paid for it.

18:00.811 --> 18:01.763
Why can't I open it?

18:03.096 --> 18:04.366
Will you be responsible if he gets drunk?

18:04.841 --> 18:05.510
Sure.

18:08.789 --> 18:09.529
"Sure"?

18:12.351 --> 18:13.290
Ye Zi.

18:14.791 --> 18:16.430
I remember your school was pretty good.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.020
It's graduation season.

18:18.218 --> 18:19.558
Why aren't you looking for a real job?

18:19.583 --> 18:20.724
Why are you doing odd jobs here?

18:21.030 --> 18:22.030
It's hard to find a job.

18:22.831 --> 18:24.260
Didn't you become an influencer?

18:24.960 --> 18:27.371
Why are you so serious about this part-time job?

18:28.094 --> 18:29.234
Isn't it good to work hard?

18:33.240 --> 18:34.171
Let me tell you.

18:34.510 --> 18:35.440
Young lady.

18:36.510 --> 18:37.681
You're still young.

18:38.141 --> 18:40.311
Don't keep thinking about unrealistic things.

18:41.250 --> 18:42.881
Do you look like that person?

18:43.220 --> 18:44.220
No.

18:44.550 --> 18:46.020
Similar, but not identical.

18:46.621 --> 18:47.690
Big difference.

18:49.091 --> 18:49.921
After finishing work today,

18:50.190 --> 18:51.220
get your pay from Finance.

18:51.661 --> 18:52.530
Don't come tomorrow.

18:55.361 --> 18:56.030
Xiao Zhou.

18:56.431 --> 18:57.200
Take this.

18:57.460 --> 18:58.131
Get me a bottle of water.

18:58.200 --> 18:59.171
Give me my clothes.

18:59.571 --> 19:00.230
Okay.

19:01.871 --> 19:02.641
Later,

19:02.841 --> 19:03.601
I have to go ahead.

19:03.740 --> 19:04.800
Call a chauffeur for Mr. Meng.

19:05.101 --> 19:05.770
Okay.

19:05.841 --> 19:06.510
Yes, sir.

19:10.940 --> 19:12.010
What's the matter with him?

19:12.081 --> 19:13.510
Why is he so fierce today?

19:14.450 --> 19:15.181
What did he say?

19:15.250 --> 19:17.480
"Similar but not identical."

19:17.550 --> 19:19.091
"Big difference."

19:19.421 --> 19:20.921
Who is he talking about?

19:30.237 --> 19:31.038
Here.

19:31.861 --> 19:33.300
This is the purest vodka.

19:33.470 --> 19:34.171
Try it.

19:39.841 --> 19:41.071
Do you think I'm stupid?

19:42.740 --> 19:43.811
Rest a bit.

19:43.881 --> 19:45.341
Drink some water.

19:45.950 --> 19:47.250
My old man just called me.

19:47.311 --> 19:48.280
He told me to go home first.

19:48.681 --> 19:49.550
I'll get going.

19:50.151 --> 19:50.950
Stop drinking.

19:51.020 --> 19:51.881
When I come back later,

19:51.950 --> 19:53.091
don't let me see you here.

19:53.151 --> 19:54.351
I'm telling on you.

20:24.351 --> 20:25.121
Hello, Mr. Meng.

20:25.181 --> 20:26.490
Kaming Chauffeur Service is at your service.

20:26.550 --> 20:27.921
Please fasten your seat belt.

20:29.151 --> 20:30.421
I thought you already quit this.

20:32.591 --> 20:34.361
Everyone wants more ways to make money.

20:35.331 --> 20:36.460
You haven't fastened your seatbelt.

20:41.431 --> 20:42.270
Are you drunk?

21:01.621 --> 21:02.891
We're turning left up ahead.

21:03.921 --> 21:04.790
Merge lines ahead of time.

21:06.190 --> 21:07.661
I guess you're really not that drunk.

21:08.931 --> 21:10.200
People like you...

21:10.401 --> 21:12.230
never get drunk, do you?

21:15.270 --> 21:16.641
What kind of person am I?

21:16.700 --> 21:17.841
Extremely disciplined.

21:18.641 --> 21:20.210
Even when drinking to drown your sorrows.

21:21.510 --> 21:23.181
I'll be making an exception today then.

21:30.550 --> 21:32.280
Cold air is the worst when you're drunk.

21:42.161 --> 21:42.831
Are you okay?

21:48.200 --> 21:49.030
Are you all right?

21:52.300 --> 21:53.440
Here's some tissue for you.

22:01.681 --> 22:03.581
I'll be troubling the cleaning lady.

22:06.091 --> 22:07.020
I'm sorry.

22:24.901 --> 22:26.671
Are you upset about something?

22:32.911 --> 22:33.581
No.

22:36.050 --> 22:37.151
It sounds like you're lying.

22:38.821 --> 22:39.490
I'm not.

22:42.220 --> 22:43.561
I just don't have anything...

22:44.561 --> 22:45.591
to be happy about.

22:49.460 --> 22:51.061
How can you be happy then?

22:57.270 --> 22:58.341
I won't be happy anymore.

23:17.220 --> 23:18.220
I'll never be happy anymore.

23:21.591 --> 23:22.831
Never.

23:35.141 --> 23:35.811
It's here.

23:36.210 --> 23:37.040
This is the right establishment, isn't it?

23:40.881 --> 23:41.550
Hello.

23:42.311 --> 23:42.980
Is anyone here?

23:43.480 --> 23:44.950
Hello. Who called the police?

23:46.690 --> 23:47.750
Where is she?

23:48.190 --> 23:49.020
I did!

23:50.661 --> 23:51.821
Hello. What's the matter?

23:52.561 --> 23:53.230
I...

23:55.030 --> 23:57.800
There's a spider upstairs.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.431
It's huge!

23:59.730 --> 24:00.401
But...

24:00.700 --> 24:02.371
But I'm too scared to catch it.

24:02.500 --> 24:04.040
Please catch it for me.

24:04.101 --> 24:05.270
Don't worry. We'll take care of it.

24:06.710 --> 24:07.371
Da Peng.

24:08.470 --> 24:09.440
Are you afraid of spiders?

24:09.510 --> 24:10.710
If you're scared, hide behind me.

24:17.750 --> 24:18.421
Ma'am.

24:18.480 --> 24:19.921
Where exactly did you find the spider?

24:20.550 --> 24:21.290
Over there.

24:21.990 --> 24:23.760
Pi Pi, Da Peng, Ge Zheng, go.

24:23.821 --> 24:24.490
- Okay. - Okay.

24:42.740 --> 24:43.740
Be careful.

24:44.141 --> 24:45.210
That's quite expensive.

24:45.280 --> 24:45.940
Ge Zheng.

24:46.181 --> 24:47.050
Lift and put things down gently.

24:47.111 --> 24:47.780
Okay.

24:48.980 --> 24:49.921
Lift and put things down gently.

25:04.460 --> 25:05.300
Be careful.

25:06.030 --> 25:07.101
That is even more expensive.

25:16.980 --> 25:17.641
Hello.

25:18.381 --> 25:19.381
Are you sure it's here?

25:19.550 --> 25:20.510
I can't find it anywhere.

25:20.980 --> 25:22.280
I'm sure it's here.

25:22.750 --> 25:24.081
I saw it with my own eyes. It's over there.

25:24.520 --> 25:25.220
Miss.

25:26.151 --> 25:27.891
Is the spider really this big?

25:29.990 --> 25:31.190
Anyway, it's quite big.

25:31.760 --> 25:32.520
Yang Chi, Jiang Yi.

25:32.760 --> 25:33.631
I really don't see any spiders.

25:34.260 --> 25:35.030
We don't see any here either.

25:35.190 --> 25:35.931
There's none here either.

25:36.401 --> 25:37.401
Did it go downstairs?

25:39.831 --> 25:40.631
It's here!

25:41.470 --> 25:42.300
It's on your back.

25:42.401 --> 25:43.700
Don't move. Da Peng, don't move.

25:47.270 --> 25:48.040
It's only this big.

25:49.411 --> 25:50.641
Pi Pi, catch the spider.

25:56.597 --> 25:57.658
Miss, is this it?

25:58.980 --> 25:59.651
Yes.

25:59.720 --> 26:00.550
Right.

26:01.351 --> 26:02.020
Ma'am.

26:02.490 --> 26:03.260
The problem has been solved.

26:03.321 --> 26:04.391
We'll be leaving then.

26:04.760 --> 26:05.760
Okay, thank you.

26:05.821 --> 26:07.131
You're welcome. We're just doing our jobs.

26:07.591 --> 26:08.260
Let's go.

26:08.530 --> 26:09.290
Come on.

26:09.831 --> 26:10.700
This spider is huge.

26:12.401 --> 26:13.371
Thank you for your hard work.

26:18.015 --> 26:18.785
Wait.

26:20.911 --> 26:21.811
Well...

26:23.574 --> 26:25.005
Do you have a girlfriend?

26:31.550 --> 26:32.351
Yes.

26:36.121 --> 26:37.520
Thank you for your hard work.

26:38.061 --> 26:39.061
Thank you.

26:39.931 --> 26:40.591
Bye.

26:41.861 --> 26:42.661
- It's settled. - Okay.

26:43.331 --> 26:44.131
You can all go now.

26:44.695 --> 26:45.935
Wait, Ge Zheng, do you have a girlfriend?

26:45.960 --> 26:46.700
I don't.

26:46.770 --> 26:47.631
Serves you right.

27:00.151 --> 27:01.710
We're catching spiders late at night.

27:01.980 --> 27:02.750
That's awesome.

27:04.050 --> 27:06.020
Last time, Squad Two even helped catch a gecko.

27:06.351 --> 27:07.091
That's right.

27:23.101 --> 27:23.770
Ge Zheng.

27:23.940 --> 27:24.601
What's up, Jiang Yi?

27:24.671 --> 27:25.841
Is that your girlfriend?

27:26.795 --> 27:27.611
You're right.

27:28.141 --> 27:28.811
Yes.

27:28.871 --> 27:29.571
Call out to her.

27:29.843 --> 27:31.083
No, there are so many cars.

27:31.940 --> 27:32.681
Don't be shy.

27:32.740 --> 27:33.611
It's not easy to run into her.

27:33.681 --> 27:35.181
Why won't you say hi? Are you stupid?

27:36.750 --> 27:37.421
Lu Xiao Qiu!

27:37.950 --> 27:39.581
- Lu Xiao Qiu. - She's working.

27:42.238 --> 27:43.738
Do you have anything to eat or drink?

27:44.190 --> 27:44.990
Lao Li.

27:48.190 --> 27:49.061
Give her something to drink.

27:50.161 --> 27:50.901
Are you cold?

27:51.004 --> 27:51.675
No.

27:51.700 --> 27:53.209
What's your mission today?

27:53.348 --> 27:54.149
Catching spiders.

27:54.709 --> 27:55.369
Catching spiders?

27:56.000 --> 27:56.940
Yes, this is for you.

27:57.371 --> 27:58.341
How long until you get off work?

27:58.401 --> 27:59.841
About an hour.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.540
Another hour?

28:04.036 --> 28:05.175
Stay warm then.

28:05.200 --> 28:05.869
Okay.

28:06.040 --> 28:06.780
Dress warmly.

28:20.460 --> 28:21.831
This mission wasn't a waste, was it?

28:22.733 --> 28:23.730
I came for nothing.

28:23.800 --> 28:25.300
I even lost two bottles of drinks, Jiang Yi.

28:25.631 --> 28:26.671
I'll return them to you.

28:27.601 --> 28:29.270
I'm like a single person...

28:29.770 --> 28:30.641
walking on the street...

28:30.871 --> 28:32.470
who got kicked for no reason.

28:32.871 --> 28:34.240
It doesn't just seem like it. You are.

30:07.300 --> 30:08.071
You're up.

30:14.871 --> 30:15.740
Why are you here?

30:16.311 --> 30:17.181
This is my house.

30:18.841 --> 30:19.780
Why am I here?

30:20.311 --> 30:21.081
Have you forgotten?

30:21.151 --> 30:22.280
You were drunk last night.

30:23.282 --> 30:24.782
I'm asking you. Why am I here?

30:24.950 --> 30:26.591
My address is on the order.

30:30.290 --> 30:31.921
Since you're a rich guy,

30:32.161 --> 30:33.861
you think I have a hidden agenda.

30:37.331 --> 30:39.105
You refused to get out of the car yesterday.

30:39.200 --> 30:41.030
You refused to go home even when we were at the garage.

30:41.278 --> 30:43.149
You said you'd go anywhere as long as you didn't go home.

30:43.557 --> 30:45.417
I really don't know where to take you.

30:52.311 --> 30:53.151
I'm sorry.

30:56.520 --> 30:57.421
I don't remember at all.

30:59.720 --> 31:01.020
You're saying you're sorry,

31:02.020 --> 31:03.591
but it's like you're suspecting that I'm lying.

31:10.000 --> 31:11.030
Is it the first time you blacked out from drinking?

31:13.335 --> 31:14.194
You should have...

31:15.071 --> 31:16.700
left me in our garage.

31:18.071 --> 31:18.800
Where's my jacket?

31:19.500 --> 31:20.341
I should get back.

31:20.470 --> 31:21.171
Wait.

31:21.740 --> 31:22.911
I bought two servings of breakfast.

31:23.358 --> 31:24.259
Don't waste the food.

31:27.480 --> 31:30.050
You threw up on the floor and apologized to the cleaner.

31:30.881 --> 31:32.220
But you have no basic respect or courtesy...

31:32.280 --> 31:34.151
for a part-time bar staff like me.

31:35.520 --> 31:36.290
Mr. Meng.

31:36.990 --> 31:38.190
You're an interesting person.

31:42.530 --> 31:43.401
Did you stay...

31:44.230 --> 31:45.161
in the dormitory last night?

31:46.061 --> 31:46.800
Of course.

31:48.871 --> 31:50.470
I bought this toothpaste and toothbrush for you.

31:50.841 --> 31:52.740
You'll only use it once anyway, so I bought the cheapest one.

31:55.710 --> 31:56.540
The restroom is there.

31:57.881 --> 31:58.540
Thank you.

32:47.230 --> 32:48.131
Are you renting...

32:48.460 --> 32:49.391
this place by yourself?

32:49.631 --> 32:50.760
I'm renting it with my classmate.

32:53.161 --> 32:54.970
She had a class last night, so she didn't come home.

32:58.800 --> 32:59.500
Then have you...

32:59.800 --> 33:01.141
paid off your student loan?

33:03.141 --> 33:03.980
Almost.

33:05.111 --> 33:06.381
You want to know the rent, right?

33:07.780 --> 33:09.581
Last month, we gained quite a lot of followers.

33:09.750 --> 33:11.151
More people want to work with me too.

33:11.821 --> 33:13.621
We've got too many goods that will crowd the dorm.

33:13.950 --> 33:15.220
I'm graduating soon anyway.

33:15.290 --> 33:16.290
I might as well rent a place in advance,

33:16.351 --> 33:17.520
so I won't have to look for a place later.

33:20.460 --> 33:21.530
Why do college students nowadays...

33:22.361 --> 33:23.831
all want to be influencers?

33:24.861 --> 33:26.260
Such a good university's students are the same.

33:26.800 --> 33:27.631
What else can we do?

33:28.831 --> 33:29.871
Should we starve?

33:32.071 --> 33:33.200
To have a dream,

33:33.540 --> 33:35.010
you need to have a material foundation.

33:35.540 --> 33:37.681
It's not suitable for me now to pursue it.

33:43.081 --> 33:43.750
I won't comment...

33:45.151 --> 33:46.020
on your point of view.

33:57.161 --> 33:58.161
It smells so good.

34:01.770 --> 34:03.071
You're up so early.

34:04.000 --> 34:04.740
It's done.

34:10.040 --> 34:11.081
Here, have breakfast.

34:22.351 --> 34:23.251
On Monday, the day after tomorrow,

34:23.320 --> 34:24.360
are you already going to work?

34:25.621 --> 34:27.130
I've been on sick leave for a long time.

34:28.831 --> 34:29.490
Here.

34:33.431 --> 34:34.101
Then...

34:34.170 --> 34:35.700
I won't see you for a long time, right?

34:39.501 --> 34:40.470
Aren't you used to...

34:41.271 --> 34:42.311
living alone now?

34:43.070 --> 34:43.840
That's not true.

34:45.280 --> 34:46.981
I've been living alone all these years.

34:47.450 --> 34:49.510
I'm the one who's not used to living with you these days.

34:52.181 --> 34:53.490
I'll be back next weekend.

34:56.560 --> 34:58.161
A week actually goes by quite fast.

34:58.521 --> 35:00.360
Your management is quite humane now.

35:03.061 --> 35:04.400
There's something even more humane.

35:04.860 --> 35:05.630
What is it?

35:05.700 --> 35:06.400
Come here.

35:09.200 --> 35:09.900
Local...

35:10.470 --> 35:11.240
married people...

35:12.840 --> 35:14.641
get more days off.

35:14.840 --> 35:15.610
Really?

35:20.805 --> 35:21.934
Do you want to consider it?

35:22.581 --> 35:23.481
Eat your food.

35:31.061 --> 35:32.090
(Mom)

35:34.391 --> 35:35.431
I need to take this call.

35:39.300 --> 35:39.961
Hello?

35:40.271 --> 35:41.001
Qin Qin.

35:43.641 --> 35:44.300
Mom.

35:44.757 --> 35:45.597
Where are you?

35:46.470 --> 35:47.170
I'm at home, Mom.

35:47.240 --> 35:48.441
I'm preparing to go to work.

35:50.379 --> 35:51.649
Do you work on weekends too?

35:54.616 --> 35:55.985
I asked you to come home last weekend,

35:56.010 --> 35:57.050
but you didn't.

35:57.851 --> 35:58.880
I've been quite busy lately.

35:59.181 --> 36:00.621
So busy that you can't come home?

36:00.720 --> 36:02.320
Too busy to go on blind dates?

36:02.550 --> 36:04.820
Are you going to be too busy to get married in the future too?

36:08.661 --> 36:09.431
Mom,

36:09.490 --> 36:11.331
I'll take care of my own matters.

36:12.501 --> 36:13.400
Tonight,

36:13.864 --> 36:14.663
you should come home.

36:15.501 --> 36:17.170
You haven't been home for over a month.

36:20.740 --> 36:21.510
Tomorrow.

36:22.271 --> 36:23.211
It's my day off tomorrow.

36:23.411 --> 36:24.441
I'll go home in the morning.

36:25.311 --> 36:26.911
If you're so busy...

36:27.050 --> 36:28.780
that you can't come home for over a month,

36:29.311 --> 36:31.150
I'll call your boss...

36:31.581 --> 36:32.720
to get a leave for you.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.760
I got it.

36:52.800 --> 36:53.510
Here.

36:53.711 --> 36:54.670
It's getting cold.

36:58.441 --> 36:59.981
My mom just called me.

37:00.911 --> 37:02.050
She wants me to go home.

37:04.181 --> 37:04.851
Go ahead.

37:05.320 --> 37:06.081
I...

37:06.150 --> 37:07.950
I won't be staying here tonight.

37:11.061 --> 37:12.820
I'll come back tomorrow.

37:13.990 --> 37:14.691
Okay.

37:14.961 --> 37:15.661
I'll wait for you.

37:16.061 --> 37:16.760
Here.

37:25.070 --> 37:26.871
Chief Song, eat more.

37:56.501 --> 37:57.441
Doctor!

37:57.501 --> 37:58.601
Hurry! Someone's hurt!

37:58.670 --> 37:59.840
Hurry up!

38:01.141 --> 38:02.541
There's a lot of blood on her hand.

38:02.610 --> 38:03.941
It's fine. It's not serious.

38:04.041 --> 38:04.740
There was such a big fire.

38:04.811 --> 38:05.880
It's really scary.

38:05.941 --> 38:06.780
I know.

38:07.311 --> 38:08.280
What a relief.

38:08.581 --> 38:10.050
Luckily, she's not that seriously hurt.

38:10.521 --> 38:11.621
There was a girl on the bus...

38:11.681 --> 38:12.550
who was incredible.

38:12.621 --> 38:14.920
She broke the car window with a hammer...

38:14.990 --> 38:16.090
and got us out.

38:16.420 --> 38:17.220
Otherwise,

38:17.561 --> 38:18.490
it would've been a disaster.

38:18.561 --> 38:20.021
Yes, she's so young.

38:20.161 --> 38:21.561
She's calm and decisive.

38:21.791 --> 38:22.561
She's over there.

38:22.774 --> 38:23.475
That's the girl.

38:23.500 --> 38:24.540
The one talking to the driver.

38:24.844 --> 38:25.875
Yes, that's her.

38:25.900 --> 38:26.831
She's the one who saved us.

38:26.900 --> 38:28.501
If there's nothing else, I'll get going.

38:28.570 --> 38:29.231
You can go now.

38:32.041 --> 38:32.941
She saved us.

38:33.041 --> 38:33.711
It was her.

38:34.010 --> 38:34.941
It's all thanks to her.

38:35.411 --> 38:36.411
Hey.

38:37.554 --> 38:38.355
Zhai Miao.

38:38.380 --> 38:39.554
- You were on the bus too? - That's the girl who...

38:40.110 --> 38:41.081
She saved all of us on the bus.

38:41.150 --> 38:42.450
- She's amazing. - Without you, we couldn't get out.

38:42.681 --> 38:44.681
She's so brave at such a young age.

38:45.021 --> 38:45.780
She's so smart.

38:45.851 --> 38:47.351
I'm a firefighter's family.

38:47.464 --> 38:48.795
If I can't even do this right,

38:48.820 --> 38:50.391
I'll embarrass my cousin.

38:50.760 --> 38:51.691
Don't you agree, my sister-in-law?

38:53.061 --> 38:54.590
Just call me Xu Qin.

38:55.007 --> 38:55.806
I can't do that.

38:55.831 --> 38:56.661
My brother said...

38:56.731 --> 38:57.760
I can't be disrespectful.

38:58.260 --> 39:00.030
Otherwise, he'll beat me up again when he gets home.

39:02.970 --> 39:04.700
What did he tell his family?

39:05.340 --> 39:06.041
My sister-in-law.

39:06.340 --> 39:09.141
There were some unpleasant things between us before.

39:09.610 --> 39:11.411
But that's because I regarded you as an outsider.

39:11.941 --> 39:12.911
Now,

39:13.141 --> 39:14.311
we're family.

39:14.380 --> 39:15.711
I'll surely be good to you.

39:16.736 --> 39:17.705
What happened before...

39:18.380 --> 39:19.621
Let's put it behind us, okay?

39:21.751 --> 39:22.791
Are you hurt?

39:23.291 --> 39:23.961
I'm fine.

39:24.021 --> 39:24.720
Don't worry.

39:25.621 --> 39:26.961
A hole is even burned in your clothes.

39:27.590 --> 39:28.990
I have a spare. I'll get you one.

39:29.061 --> 39:29.731
It's okay.

39:29.791 --> 39:30.661
Get back to work.

39:30.731 --> 39:31.630
I won't disturb you.

39:32.501 --> 39:33.200
Bye.

39:37.541 --> 39:38.441
After you get home,

39:38.501 --> 39:40.411
don't get your wound wet.

39:40.641 --> 39:41.941
Watch your diet.

39:43.010 --> 39:44.240
Get enough sleep.

39:52.521 --> 39:54.351
Do you want to go shopping together after work?

39:55.021 --> 39:56.291
I'll pass.

39:56.351 --> 39:57.260
My mom is coming to see me.

39:57.320 --> 39:58.360
I'll pick her up at the airport.

39:58.720 --> 39:59.661
I'll pass too.

39:59.720 --> 40:00.731
I have something to do later.

40:01.130 --> 40:03.260
Are you going on a date with that firefighter...

40:03.331 --> 40:04.360
from last time?

40:04.661 --> 40:05.630
What's his name?

40:06.200 --> 40:07.300
Zhan Da Peng.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.200
That's right.

40:08.271 --> 40:10.070
Is there a new development between you two?

40:10.371 --> 40:11.340
I'm just answering...

40:11.400 --> 40:12.601
her question.

40:13.601 --> 40:15.570
I didn't say I had a relationship with him.

40:15.641 --> 40:16.411
Let me tell you.

40:16.470 --> 40:17.311
Don't spread rumors.

40:17.510 --> 40:18.740
I'm going to a class reunion.

40:20.600 --> 40:23.231
I really think that young men are quite nice.

40:23.256 --> 40:24.656
It doesn't matter. Forget it.

40:24.681 --> 40:25.481
I can't handle him.

40:26.150 --> 40:26.920
What's the matter?

40:27.065 --> 40:29.295
Can't 120 even handle 119?

40:29.320 --> 40:30.461
Your number is higher.

40:30.521 --> 40:32.391
You're higher in rank than him.

40:32.791 --> 40:34.791
I'm way older than him too.

40:35.392 --> 40:36.762
It's good to be older.

40:37.075 --> 40:38.175
Young men...

40:38.200 --> 40:40.030
are positive and cheerful.

40:40.101 --> 40:41.170
And childish too.

40:42.170 --> 40:43.871
You haven't even gotten to know him yet.

40:43.970 --> 40:45.170
How would you know if he's childish?

40:45.840 --> 40:46.740
That's right.

40:46.900 --> 40:48.941
You have to try everything.

40:49.010 --> 40:50.371
You're always afraid of this and that.

40:50.441 --> 40:51.280
You think too much.

40:51.340 --> 40:52.081
That's right.

40:52.141 --> 40:53.280
If you don't choose to begin it,

40:53.340 --> 40:54.950
how would you know the ending?

40:55.280 --> 40:56.050
Besides,

40:56.150 --> 40:57.220
you have to choose to begin it...

40:57.280 --> 40:58.521
to push the ending...

40:58.581 --> 40:59.880
in a good direction.

41:00.521 --> 41:01.621
If you don't choose to begin it,

41:01.751 --> 41:03.420
you can indeed avoid a bad ending.

41:03.621 --> 41:04.320
However,

41:04.391 --> 41:06.061
there won't be a good ending either.

41:07.360 --> 41:09.191
Dr. Xu, it's fine if you don't say anything.

41:09.561 --> 41:11.661
But you make a lot of sense when you do.

41:12.061 --> 41:12.900
Dr. Li.

41:13.101 --> 41:14.431
Watch and learn.

41:15.030 --> 41:15.900
However,

41:15.993 --> 41:18.255
if all signs indicate...

41:18.280 --> 41:20.280
that there's a high probability of a bad outcome,

41:20.610 --> 41:22.141
why go through it?

41:22.686 --> 41:23.686
If nothing comes out of it,

41:23.711 --> 41:25.211
at least there was a process.

41:25.711 --> 41:27.851
No matter what, you'll have no regrets...

41:28.050 --> 41:28.981
if you once had him.

41:30.780 --> 41:31.481
I'll get going.

41:32.522 --> 41:33.422
- Bye, Dr. Xu. - Bye.

41:33.499 --> 41:34.669
Bye, Dr. Xu.

41:37.791 --> 41:39.061
Now, Dr. Xu...

41:39.121 --> 41:41.431
even gossips with us.

41:42.191 --> 41:43.391
Did I hear her right?

41:45.300 --> 41:46.561
Learn from her.

41:48.170 --> 41:49.670
- Let's go. - Bye.
